!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Mitigacion de DHCP Spoofing (DHCP Snooping)
en
conf term
!!!! Habilitar DHCP Snooping globalmente
ip dhcp snooping

!!!! Aplicar a VLAN1
ip dhcp snooping vlan 1

!!!! Puerto hacia el servidor DHCP legitimo = trusted
interface GigabitEthernet0/0
ip dhcp snooping trust
exit

!!!! Puerto del atacante = untrusted (por defecto)
!!!! Limitar paquetes DHCP en puerto atacante
interface GigabitEthernet0/1
ip dhcp snooping limit rate 10
exit
do wr
